# GitHub Personal Access Token
# Required for authenticated API requests (higher rate limits: 30/min search, 5000/hr REST)
# Without this key, requests will fail with 401 Unauthorized.
#
# How to generate one:
#   1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens
#   2. Click "Generate new token (classic)"
#   3. Give it any name, set an expiry, and select NO scopes (public data only)
#   4. Copy the token and paste it below
#
# Then copy this file to .env and fill in the value:
#   cp .env.example .env

VITE_APP_GITHUB_API_KEY=your_token_here
